  "bodyHash": "2f1941103d0b7ec0",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#e5e5e5;font-size:28px\">音樂通知</span></p>\n<p>當遊戲中播放音樂時，會顯示彈出通知，包含曲目名稱、作者和專輯名稱。</p>\n<h3><strong>需要</strong>: <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>📷 遊戲內截圖</h1>\n<div>\n<table style=\"width:85.0344%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast_album.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">顯示專輯名稱\": true</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/toasts.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"344\" height=\"252\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">不同的通知配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/1.21.8/img/modded1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">與模組內容相容 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-mc-music-discs\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多音樂唱片</a>)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/.github/assets/jukebox_home_tab.webp\" alt=\"留聲機選單\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><img src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/img/jukebox.png)\" alt=\"\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">使用留聲機選單隨時隨地播放任何音樂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>🎀 通知樣式</h1>\n<div>\n<table style=\"width:85.0344%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/legacy_toast.webp\" alt=\"留聲機選單\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"><img src=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/raw/next/img/jukebox.png)\" alt=\"\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">一般通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/action_bar.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">動作列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/style/compact.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:99.9285%;text-align:center\">精簡版</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h1>⚙ 設定</h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/next/.github/assets/config.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>影片預覽</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fHK2swFtPanA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://youtu.be/HK2swFtPanA</a></p>\n<h1>自定義</h1>\n<blockquote>\n<p>要為自定義音樂或修改現有曲目添加支援，你需要在自定義資源包下的命名空間 musicnotification 中添加一個名為 musics.json 的文件。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>JSON Schema 可在此處找到：<a href=\"https://github.com/KosmoMoustache/MusicNotification/blob/next-stonecutter/DOCS.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DOCS.md</a><br>如果你有任何問題，歡迎提交 Issue。</p>\n<h1>貢獻者</h1>\n<p>唱片圖標由 <a href=\"https://github.com/carotteatomique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">carotteatomique</a> 製作<br>模組圖標由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdribbble.com%252fakairoo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">akairoo</a> 製作<br>繁體中文翻譯由 <a href=\"https://github.com/Chiloven945\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chiloven945</a> 完成</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
